{"municipality_code":"28224","pref":"兵庫県","city":"南あわじ市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"南あわじ市には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは港町・水運、社寺・地域信仰に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の船越景直との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。 「大和大国魂神社」や「自凝島神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":4,"rank":1493,"percentile":19.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":5,"rank":1086,"percentile":40.2,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":43,"rank":574,"percentile":69.1,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":16,"rank":452,"percentile":74.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":7,"rank":620,"percentile":64.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":13,"rank":329,"percentile":80.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":114,"rank":95,"percentile":94.9,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":2,"rank":33,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["船越景直","古東領左衛門","樋口季一郎","服部嵐雪","立川雲平"],"tourism_la